<title>PORTUGAL: Eurofima launches 10 bln esc Navigator bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima launches 10 bln esc Navigator bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced</p>
<p>by lead managers Banco Santander de Negocios Portugal and Caixa</p>
<p>Geral de Depositos:</p>
<p>    BORROWER Eurofima   AMT 10 billion escudos</p>
<p>COUPON 6-month Lisbor plus 10 basis points, nine pct max</p>
<p>    ISS PRICE Par	 PAY DATE 16.7.97</p>
<p>    LAST MOODY Aaa	LAST S&amp;P AAA</p>
<p>Base for interest calculation: Actual/365</p>
<p>    LISTING Lux	   CLEARING Euroclear/Cedel</p>
<p>GOV LAW English</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
